Upstream-Name: iPXE
Source: https://github.com/ipxe/ipxe/releases/tag/v2.0.0
Comment: ipxeboot-2.0.0.tar.gz is the ipxeboot.tar.gz asset of the iPXE v2.0.0
 release, unchanged. ipxe-2.0.0-source.tar.gz is the source archive of tag
 v2.0.0, installed as /usr/share/doc/ipxe-xcat/ipxe-2.0.0-source.tar.gz.
 .
 The files x86_64-sb/shimx64.efi and arm64-sb/shimaa64.efi in the release tree
 are shim 16.1, built by the iPXE project from ipxe/shim tag ipxe-16.1. Shim is
 under the BSD licence in licenses/shim/COPYRIGHT and includes OpenSSL 1.0.2k
 (licenses/shim/openssl/LICENSE) and gnu-efi (licenses/shim/gnu-efi/README.efilib).
 .
 The licence texts are installed in /usr/share/doc/ipxe-xcat/licenses/.

